session Unpatched_Examples in Unpatched_Examples = HOL +
  description \<open>
    Counterexamples in Isabelle2026 without the patches of patches/, one theory per patch:
    proofs of False (04, 05), lost unifiers and failed proof steps (01, 02, 03, 15), and
    ill-typed tight proofs (08-14), and
    ill-typed classic and tight proofs by assumption (18). The proofs of False for patches 06 and 07
    (Unpatched_06_Thm_Rename_Flexflex, Unpatched_07_Thm_Rename_Lifting, by Kappelmann and Huch,
    isabelle-users, 27 October 2026) are not part of the session: the installed Isabelle
    already contains these patches. The theories set the global Proofterm.proofs, so they are
    processed one at a time.
  \<close>
  options [threads = 1]
  theories
    Unpatched_Base
    Unpatched_01_Pattern_Rigid_Occurs
    Unpatched_02_Unify_Rigid_Occurs
    Unpatched_03_Unify_Flexflex
    Unpatched_04_Unify_Cyclic
    Unpatched_05_Unify_Saturate
    Unpatched_08_ZTerm_Ofclass
    Unpatched_09_ZTerm_Norm_Ofclass
    Unpatched_10_ZTerm_Lift_Frees
    Unpatched_11_ZTerm_Lift_Hyps
    Unpatched_12_ZTerm_Flatten
    Unpatched_13_ZTerm_Asm
    Unpatched_14_Thm_ZTerm_Rename
    Unpatched_15_Thm_Quick_Eres
    Unpatched_18_Thm_Assumption
    Unpatched_Incremented

